  "keyFeatures": [
    "Multi-module ERP for cooperative organizations",
    "Insurance policy and claims management (Seguros)",
    "Exequial (funeral) services management",
    "Credit and loan lifecycle management",
    "Document management and electronic archiving (GDO)",
    "Correspondence and document workflow management",
    "Portfolio and accounting reconciliation",
    "Five-percent (Cinco) savings fund management",
    "Reservations and real estate management",
    "Inventory and asset tracking",
    "CRM interactions and support ticket system",
    "Role-based access control via Spatie Permissions",
    "Excel bulk import/export for data synchronization",
    "Indicators, KPIs, and quiz assessments",
    "PWA support for mobile access"
